    "detailed_description": "<h1>Awards</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/d62102b0806fb214adfa9cfae0f718e5.avif?t=1742909012\" width=520 height=373 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/c910a7d1288227320cea496ea7c7dae3.avif?t=1742909012\" width=600 height=168 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/0e4e2568c53c67ad719243f6e5987ebf.poster.avif?t=1742909012\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/0e4e2568c53c67ad719243f6e5987ebf.webm?t=1742909012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/0e4e2568c53c67ad719243f6e5987ebf.mp4?t=1742909012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blink and Die is a musical bullet hell with arcade aesthetics, in first-person, where you must move 360 degrees to dodge bars that moves to the song's rhythm and comes from all angles. Get to know the world of Blinky, an AI that will do everything possible to ensure you have fun. Unlock and choose levels in an arcade environment. Each level has its own visual and musical style; Blinky will dress up for each occasion to watch you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/9ed988927f067928edfd730c2f23f14e.poster.avif?t=1742909012\" width=616 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/9ed988927f067928edfd730c2f23f14e.webm?t=1742909012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/9ed988927f067928edfd730c2f23f14e.mp4?t=1742909012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/b23be5284489e8ad5c5b5a01f917546c.avif?t=1742909012\" width=600 height=168 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>10 Levels with Original Aesthetics and Music:</strong></li></ul> Each level has its own personality as well as its own Blinky. From Matrix-style hacker cities to neon cyberspaces.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Soundtrack:</strong></li></ul> The tracks of Blink and Die will resonate in your mind for a long time. Mixing synthesizers and dance music, rock, metal, and orchestrations.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Simple Controls:</strong></li></ul> Use your mouse. You will need to refine your precision and reflexes.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>3 Difficulties:</strong></li></ul> Relax, Move or Lose, Blink and Die.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Interactive Levels:</strong></li></ul> Each level follows the song aesthethic, both in its visuals and in the difficulty of the bars you must dodge, which will become more challenging based on the emotion of the track.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/23901598c48512cf8e5b6b99230d05f9.poster.avif?t=1742909012\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/23901598c48512cf8e5b6b99230d05f9.webm?t=1742909012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/23901598c48512cf8e5b6b99230d05f9.mp4?t=1742909012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>                                                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958830/extras/cff4fddb8303d6383808844ba837ee61.avif?t=1742909012\" width=600 height=168 /></span>",
